(text "01C PREARMED ACC-OFF TIMER - SUBCIRCUIT, NOT SYSTEM-VALIDATED" (at 204.47 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000119"))
(text "ACC ON: Q912 holds TRIG low and discharges RC via D513/R515; HOLD is already armed before ACC falls." (at 204.47 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000120"))
(text "TLC555-Q1 RESET has delayed startup (R513/C513) to suppress first-boot false trigger." (at 204.47 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000121"))
(text "ACC OFF: TRIG rises, RC charges; OUT retains HIGH until timeout. U512 AND MCU_HOLD_REQ permits early release." (at 204.47 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000122"))
(text "MCU_HOLD_REQ must be active WHILE ACC is high; goes low immediately after SD unmount." (at 204.47 59.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000123"))
(text "1M / 22uF retain 22s nominal RC product with more leakage margin; actual window depends on clamp, bias and thresholds." (at 204.47 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000124"))
(text "ACC_INV_N is global from Q912; D513 K3=ACC_INV_N, A1=RC via 10k, NC2. C502 and its D501/D502 clamps removed." (at 204.47 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000125"))
(text "Native KiCad 10 ERC run; project contains unresolved violations. 555 signal function not bench tested. Do NOT order PCBA." (at 204.47 290.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15))) (uuid "904589dd-1583-4001-acce-000000000126"))
